{
  "version": "0.1.1",
  "slug": "height-expand",
  "title": "Height expand",
  "group": "Motion",
  "order": 5,
  "summary": {
    "en": "Content that opens or closes in the flow animates its height through grid rows (`0fr` to `1fr`) on the smooth spring, so everything below slides instead of jumping. The content fades in just after the space opens and fades out before it closes.",
    "id": "Konten yang terbuka atau tertutup di dalam alur menganimasikan tingginya lewat baris grid (`0fr` ke `1fr`) dengan smooth spring, sehingga semua yang di bawahnya bergeser alih-alih melompat. Konten memudar masuk sesaat setelah ruangnya terbuka dan memudar keluar sebelum ruangnya tertutup."
  },
  "titleId": "Height expand",
  "react": true,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Questions that open one at a time",
        "desc": "Open a question: the panel grows on the smooth spring and the answer fades in 80 ms later, rising 4 px. With `data-lds-accordion=\"single\"` the open one closes as the next opens; both springs run together.",
        "html": "<div class=\"acc\" data-lds-accordion=\"single\" style=\"max-width: 520px;\">\n  <div class=\"acc__item\"><button class=\"acc__btn\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"he-1\">Can I change my visit schedule?<span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button><div class=\"acc__panel is-open\" id=\"he-1\" role=\"region\"><div><p>Yes, up to one day before the appointment. After that, call the puskesmas registration desk.</p></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"acc__item\"><button class=\"acc__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"he-2\">Where can I see my checkup results?<span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button><div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"he-2\" role=\"region\"><div><p>Under History, then Checkup results. Results appear two days after the visit.</p></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"acc__item\"><button class=\"acc__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"he-3\">What if I don't show up?<span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button><div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"he-3\" role=\"region\"><div><p>Your queue number is cancelled. Register again to get a new appointment.</p></div></div></div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Dismissing an alert",
        "desc": "Close the alert: it fades while its space closes, and the content below glides up. Replay to bring it back.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-col\" style=\"max-width: 520px;\">\n  <div class=\"collapse\"><div><div class=\"alert alert--info\" role=\"status\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">info</span><div style=\"flex: 1;\"><div class=\"alert__title\">Business permit registration opens Monday at 08:00</div><div class=\"alert__body\">Applications are processed in the order they arrive.</div></div><button class=\"icon-btn alert__close\" aria-label=\"Dismiss\" data-lds-dismiss><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"card\"><p class=\"card__title\">Your applications</p><p class=\"card__sub\">2 applications, 1 waiting for verification</p></div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Show the rest of a list",
        "desc": "The first three deadlines show; the rest open under them on the same spring. The button names what it will do.",
        "html": "<div class=\"more\" data-lds-more data-more=\"Show 3 more\" data-less=\"Show less\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 420px;\">\n  <div class=\"list\">\n    <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Vehicle tax</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\">Friday, 23:59</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Waste collection fee</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\">Saturday, 12:00</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Business permit renewal</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\">Monday, 08:00</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"more__rest\"><div>\n      <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Land and building tax</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\">Wednesday, 10:00</span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Market stall fee</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\">Thursday, 23:59</span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Annual business report</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\">Next Friday</span></span></div>\n    </div></div>\n  </div>\n  <button class=\"btn btn--plain btn--sm more__btn\"></button>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Folders in a tree",
        "desc": "A folder opens its children on the spring while its chevron turns 90 degrees on the same spring, so both finish together.",
        "html": "<div class=\"tree\" role=\"tree\" aria-label=\"Application files\" style=\"max-width: 320px;\">\n  <button class=\"tree__row\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"he-t1\"><span class=\"ic tree__chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\">chevron_right</span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">folder</span>Applicant details</button>\n  <div class=\"tree__kids is-open\" id=\"he-t1\"><div><button class=\"tree__row\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">description</span>KTP.pdf</button><button class=\"tree__row\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">description</span>Family card</button></div></div>\n  <button class=\"tree__row\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"he-t2\"><span class=\"ic tree__chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\">chevron_right</span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">folder</span>Business details</button>\n  <div class=\"tree__kids\" id=\"he-t2\"><div><button class=\"tree__row\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">description</span>Photo of business premises</button><button class=\"tree__row\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">description</span>Proof of domicile letter</button></div></div>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Pertanyaan yang terbuka satu per satu",
        "desc": "Buka sebuah pertanyaan: panel tumbuh dengan smooth spring dan jawabannya memudar masuk 80 ms kemudian, naik 4 px. Dengan `data-lds-accordion=\"single\"` panel yang terbuka tertutup saat panel berikutnya terbuka; kedua spring berjalan bersamaan.",
        "html": "<div class=\"acc\" data-lds-accordion=\"single\" style=\"max-width: 520px;\">\n  <div class=\"acc__item\"><button class=\"acc__btn\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"he-1\">Bisakah saya mengubah jadwal kunjungan?<span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button><div class=\"acc__panel is-open\" id=\"he-1\" role=\"region\"><div><p>Bisa, paling lambat sehari sebelum jadwal. Setelah itu, hubungi loket pendaftaran puskesmas.</p></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"acc__item\"><button class=\"acc__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"he-2\">Di mana saya melihat hasil pemeriksaan?<span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button><div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"he-2\" role=\"region\"><div><p>Di menu Riwayat, lalu Hasil pemeriksaan. Hasil muncul dua hari setelah kunjungan.</p></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"acc__item\"><button class=\"acc__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"he-3\">Bagaimana jika saya tidak datang?<span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button><div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"he-3\" role=\"region\"><div><p>Nomor antrean Anda batal. Daftar ulang untuk mendapat jadwal baru.</p></div></div></div>\n</div>"
